---
title: Creating an attachment
endpoint: /attachments
method: post
faqItems: >
  [
    {
      "question": "What happens if I upload the same attachment twice?",
      "answer": "Re-uploading byte-identical content to the same newsletter returns the existing attachment record instead of creating a new one — the response is still a `201` with the original `id` and `file` URL. Uploads with different bytes, or the same bytes in a different newsletter, create new records as usual."
    }
  ]
---

Upload a new attachment to your Buttondown account.

This endpoint expects a multipart form data request with:
- `file` (required): The file to upload
- `name` (optional): A custom name for the attachment. If not provided, the original filename will be used.

{% faq /%}